Broadway star Laura Osnes made waves when The&nbsp;
New York Post reported that she had been fired&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:31.320
from a one-night-only production of "Crazy For&nbsp;
You" for not getting the COVID-19 shot. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:35.460
the actor later sued The Post for&nbsp;
defamation, according to Forbes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:40.200
claiming she did not get fired from the&nbsp;
show, but rather quit on her own terms.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:45.240
Osnes was hesitant to get the vaccine&nbsp;
and ultimately decided to withdraw from&nbsp;&nbsp;

